[{"s":57,"a":5,"en":"His is the dominion of the heavens and earth. And to Allah are returned [all] matters.","w":[["لَّهُۥ","For Him"],["مُلۡكُ","(is the) dominion"],["ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","(of) the heavens"],["وَٱلۡأَرۡضِۚ","and the earth"],["وَإِلَى","and to"],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah"],["تُرۡجَعُ","will be returned"],["ٱلۡأُمُورُ","the matters"]]},{"s":9,"a":82,"en":"So let them laugh a little and [then] weep much as recompense for what they used to earn.","w":[["فَلۡيَضۡحَكُواْ","So let them laugh"],["قَلِيلٗا","a little"],["وَلۡيَبۡكُواْ","and let them weep"],["كَثِيرٗا","much"],["جَزَآءَۢ","(as) a recompense"],["بِمَا","for what"],["كَانُواْ","they used to"],["يَكۡسِبُونَ","earn"]]},{"s":32,"a":21,"en":"And we will surely let them taste the nearer punishment short of the greater punishment that perhaps they will repent.","w":[["وَلَنُذِيقَنَّهُم","And surely,We will let them taste"],["مِّنَ","of"],["ٱلۡعَذَابِ","the punishment"],["ٱلۡأَدۡنَىٰ","the nearer"],["دُونَ","before"],["ٱلۡعَذَابِ","the punishment"],["ٱلۡأَكۡبَرِ","the greater"],["لَعَلَّهُمۡ","so that they may"],["يَرۡجِعُونَ","return"]]},{"s":19,"a":19,"en":"He said, \"I am only the messenger of your Lord to give you [news of] a pure boy.\"","w":[["قَالَ","He said"],["إِنَّمَآ","Only"],["أَنَا۠","I am"],["رَسُولُ","a Messenger"],["رَبِّكِ","(from) your Lord"],["لِأَهَبَ","that I (may) bestow"],["لَكِ","on you"],["غُلَٰمٗا","a son"],["زَكِيّٗا","pure"]]},{"s":68,"a":52,"en":"But it is not except a reminder to the worlds.","w":[["وَمَا","And not"],["هُوَ","it (is)"],["إِلَّا","but"],["ذِكۡرٞ","a Reminder"],["لِّلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","to the worlds"]]},{"s":53,"a":42,"en":"And that to your Lord is the finality","w":[["وَأَنَّ","And that"],["إِلَىٰ","to"],["رَبِّكَ","your Lord"],["ٱلۡمُنتَهَىٰ","(is) the final goal"]]},{"s":1,"a":2,"en":"[All] praise is [due] to Allah, Lord of the worlds -","w":[["ٱلۡحَمۡدُ","All praises and thanks"],["لِلَّهِ","(be) to Allah"],["رَبِّ","the Lord"],["ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","of the universe"]]},{"s":69,"a":40,"en":"[That] indeed, the Qur'an is the word of a noble Messenger.","w":[["إِنَّهُۥ","Indeed,it (is)"],["لَقَوۡلُ","surely (the) Word"],["رَسُولٖ","(of) a Messenger"],["كَرِيمٖ","noble"]]},{"s":50,"a":10,"en":"And lofty palm trees having fruit arranged in layers -","w":[["وَٱلنَّخۡلَ","And the palms trees"],["بَاسِقَٰتٖ","tall"],["لَّهَا","for it"],["طَلۡعٞ","(are) layers"],["نَّضِيدٞ","arranged"]]},{"s":37,"a":36,"en":"And were saying, \"Are we to leave our gods for a mad poet?\"","w":[["وَيَقُولُونَ","And they say"],["أَئِنَّا","Are we"],["لَتَارِكُوٓاْ","to leave"],["ءَالِهَتِنَا","our gods"],["لِشَاعِرٖ","for a poet"],["مَّجۡنُونِۭ","mad"]]},{"s":65,"a":9,"en":"And it tasted the bad consequence of its affair, and the outcome of its affair was loss.","w":[["فَذَاقَتۡ","So it tasted"],["وَبَالَ","(the bad) consequence"],["أَمۡرِهَا","(of) its affair"],["وَكَانَ","and was"],["عَٰقِبَةُ","(the) end"],["أَمۡرِهَا","(of) its affair"],["خُسۡرًا","loss"]]},{"s":29,"a":69,"en":"And those who strive for Us - We will surely guide them to Our ways. And indeed, Allah is with the doers of good.","w":[["وَٱلَّذِينَ","And those who"],["جَٰهَدُواْ","strive"],["فِينَا","for Us"],["لَنَهۡدِيَنَّهُمۡ","We will surely,guide them"],["سُبُلَنَاۚ","(to) Our ways"],["وَإِنَّ","And indeed"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["لَمَعَ","surely (is) with"],["ٱلۡمُحۡسِنِينَ","the good-doers"]]},{"s":50,"a":4,"en":"We know what the earth diminishes of them, and with Us is a retaining record.","w":[["قَدۡ","Certainly"],["عَلِمۡنَا","We know"],["مَا","what"],["تَنقُصُ","diminishes"],["ٱلۡأَرۡضُ","the earth"],["مِنۡهُمۡۖ","of them"],["وَعِندَنَا","and with Us"],["كِتَٰبٌ","(is) a Book"],["حَفِيظُۢ","guarded"]]},{"s":45,"a":7,"en":"Woe to every sinful liar","w":[["وَيۡلٞ","Woe"],["لِّكُلِّ","to every"],["أَفَّاكٍ","liar"],["أَثِيمٖ","sinful"]]},{"s":34,"a":29,"en":"And they say, \"When is this promise, if you should be truthful?\"","w":[["وَيَقُولُونَ","And they say"],["مَتَىٰ","When"],["هَٰذَا","(is) this"],["ٱلۡوَعۡدُ","promise"],["إِن","if"],["كُنتُمۡ","you are"],["صَٰدِقِينَ","truthful"]]},{"s":90,"a":5,"en":"Does he think that never will anyone overcome him?","w":[["أَيَحۡسَبُ","Does he think"],["أَن","that"],["لَّن","not"],["يَقۡدِرَ","has power"],["عَلَيۡهِ","over him"],["أَحَدٞ","anyone"]]},{"s":88,"a":21,"en":"So remind, [O Muhammad]; you are only a reminder.","w":[["فَذَكِّرۡ","So remind"],["إِنَّمَآ","only"],["أَنتَ","you"],["مُذَكِّرٞ","(are) a reminder"]]},{"s":82,"a":6,"en":"O mankind, what has deceived you concerning your Lord, the Generous,","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O"],["ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","man"],["مَا","What"],["غَرَّكَ","has deceived you"],["بِرَبِّكَ","concerning your Lord"],["ٱلۡكَرِيمِ","the Most Noble"]]},{"s":62,"a":3,"en":"And [to] others of them who have not yet joined them. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[["وَءَاخَرِينَ","And others"],["مِنۡهُمۡ","among them"],["لَمَّا","who have not yet"],["يَلۡحَقُواْ","joined"],["بِهِمۡۚ","them"],["وَهُوَ","and He"],["ٱلۡعَزِيزُ","(is) the All-Mighty"],["ٱلۡحَكِيمُ","the All-Wise"]]},{"s":1,"a":7,"en":"The path of those upon whom You have bestowed favor, not of those who have evoked [Your] anger or of those who are astray.","w":[["صِرَٰطَ","(The) path"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(of) those"],["أَنۡعَمۡتَ","You have bestowed (Your) Favors"],["عَلَيۡهِمۡ","on them"],["غَيۡرِ","not (of)"],["ٱلۡمَغۡضُوبِ","those who earned (Your) wrath"],["عَلَيۡهِمۡ","on themselves"],["وَلَا","and not"],["ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","(of) those who go astray"]]},{"s":14,"a":15,"en":"And they requested victory from Allah, and disappointed, [therefore], was every obstinate tyrant.","w":[["وَٱسۡتَفۡتَحُواْ","And they sought victory"],["وَخَابَ","and disappointed"],["كُلُّ","every"],["جَبَّارٍ","tyrant"],["عَنِيدٖ","obstinate"]]},{"s":100,"a":6,"en":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","mankind"],["لِرَبِّهِۦ","to his Lord"],["لَكَنُودٞ","(is) surely ungrateful"]]},{"s":85,"a":13,"en":"Indeed, it is He who originates [creation] and repeats.","w":[["إِنَّهُۥ","Indeed He"],["هُوَ","He"],["يُبۡدِئُ","originates"],["وَيُعِيدُ","and repeats"]]},{"s":69,"a":18,"en":"That Day, you will be exhibited [for judgement]; not hidden among you is anything concealed.","w":[["يَوۡمَئِذٖ","That Day"],["تُعۡرَضُونَ","you will be exhibited"],["لَا","not"],["تَخۡفَىٰ","will be hidden"],["مِنكُمۡ","among you"],["خَافِيَةٞ","any secret"]]},{"s":22,"a":24,"en":"And they had been guided [in worldly life] to good speech, and they were guided to the path of the Praiseworthy.","w":[["وَهُدُوٓاْ","And they were guided"],["إِلَى","to"],["ٱلطَّيِّبِ","the good"],["مِنَ","of"],["ٱلۡقَوۡلِ","the speech"],["وَهُدُوٓاْ","and they were guided"],["إِلَىٰ","to"],["صِرَٰطِ","(the) path"],["ٱلۡحَمِيدِ","(of) the Praiseworthy"]]},{"s":40,"a":72,"en":"In boiling water; then in the Fire they will be filled [with flame].","w":[["فِي","In"],["ٱلۡحَمِيمِ","the boiling water"],["ثُمَّ","then"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلنَّارِ","the Fire"],["يُسۡجَرُونَ","they will be burned"]]},{"s":99,"a":5,"en":"Because your Lord has commanded it.","w":[["بِأَنَّ","Because"],["رَبَّكَ","your Lord"],["أَوۡحَىٰ","inspired"],["لَهَا","[to] it"]]},{"s":101,"a":4,"en":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","w":[["يَوۡمَ","(The) Day"],["يَكُونُ","will be"],["ٱلنَّاسُ","the mankind"],["كَٱلۡفَرَاشِ","like moths"],["ٱلۡمَبۡثُوثِ","scattered"]]},{"s":109,"a":6,"en":"For you is your religion, and for me is my religion.\"","w":[["لَكُمۡ","For you"],["دِينُكُمۡ","(is) your religion"],["وَلِيَ","and for me"],["دِينِ","(is) my religion"]]},{"s":70,"a":11,"en":"They will be shown each other. The criminal will wish that he could be ransomed from the punishment of that Day by his children","w":[["يُبَصَّرُونَهُمۡۚ","They will be made to see each other"],["يَوَدُّ","Would wish"],["ٱلۡمُجۡرِمُ","the criminal"],["لَوۡ","if"],["يَفۡتَدِي","he (could be) ransomed"],["مِنۡ","from"],["عَذَابِ","(the) punishment"],["يَوۡمِئِذِۭ","(of) that Day"],["بِبَنِيهِ","by his children"]]}]